From 3af3d065b7d0c54f03d89b8c05d8b8acd4a53db4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paolo Veronelli <paolo.veronelli@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 23:54:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(#28): S28-R1 conserve overlapping appends, strengthen
 row-4 effect tests

F1: serialize integrated appends on a per-store MVar from state read
through TVar commit; payload encode forced before lock acquisition so
the auditor serialization rendezvous completes before lock wait.
Refusal persists nothing; SQL failure propagates with hot state
untouched; sequential controls unchanged.

F2: replace vacuous voted-mutation enumeration with real membership
comparisons over present and absent targets (prop subset over generated
proposals + absent/present change-roles its + absent remove it).

F1-regression: deterministic two-append conservation it binding
returned successes, SQL rows, kelLength, replay and live state.
---
 lib/KelGroups/Store.hs | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 test/S28AppApiSpec.hs  | 70 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 111 insertions(+), 29 deletions(-)

diff --git a/lib/KelGroups/Store.hs b/lib/KelGroups/Store.hs
index c101739..08c5b13 100644
